{"id": "866258143557713952", "channel_id": "736052549001674884", "author": "Noki Doki", "author_id": "170141360375070720", "timestamp": "2021-07-18T10:00:35.722000+00:00", "content": "it's because they're all uninitialized", "reply_to": null, "attachments": [], "reactions": []}
{"id": "866258337917698088", "channel_id": "736052549001674884", "author": "Noki Doki", "author_id": "170141360375070720", "timestamp": "2021-07-18T10:01:22.061000+00:00", "content": "at first they were probably bools, but then any nonzero value would bypass the check, and you'd get spins all the time", "reply_to": null, "attachments": [], "reactions": []}
{"id": "866258465340784670", "channel_id": "736052549001674884", "author": "Noki Doki", "author_id": "170141360375070720", "timestamp": "2021-07-18T10:01:52.441000+00:00", "content": "so instead of initializing their damn variables, they just made them bigger, and checked that they were exactly 1", "reply_to": null, "attachments": [], "reactions": []}
